@on_ai

Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools were used in the form of Large Language Models (LLMs), in limited form and for very specific tasks, goals, and purposes. These are disclosed herein as an ethically indispensable exercise of transparency and integrity.

Cladue Code CLI, Perplexity's AI framework, and GitHub Copilot were used as, and for the purposes of:

· Tools for speeding up the programming process: boiler-plate code generation and iteration, coding and debugging assistance, etc

· Orthographic, grammatical, and typographic review of texts and code.

· Initial research, data gathering, and data and UI exploration.

· Data analysis, cleaning, processing, and transformation assistance.

Applying to all of the above:

· All code was human-reviewed, tested, and approved. No fully *"vibe-coded"* files exist in this project.

· All (LLM-provided) sources of information were human-reviewed and cross-checked.

**No AI tools were used for:**

· Game Design

· Storyline Development

· Text, Image, Video, or Music generation.

The author's stance on the use of AI tools is strictly against AI-generated "Art", including images, videos, text, music, videogames, and other creative works that may apply. Nonetheless, LLM tools can and do provide valuable assistance as specific tools for concrete tasks, and can undoubtedly help by speeding-up of many aspects of the development workflow. Its usage as a tool must be as responsible as it is transparent. If you feel like the usages described herein attempt against your intellectual property rights, contact me via <a target="_blank" class="link" href="https://www.reddit.com/user/_BrokenArrows/">Reddit DM</a>.

